<article class="rvw__card" id="sample-{{ section.id }}-15"><div class="rvw__meta"><span class="rvw__stars" data-rating="5" role="img" aria-label="Sample rating: 5 / 5"><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span></span></div><p class="rvw__sample-label">Sample review</p><p class="rvw__who"><strong>Alexander N.</strong>, Sample date</p><h3 class="rvw__title">Quick help with my address</h3><p class="rvw__body">I noticed a mistake in my delivery address after placing the order. Customer service helped me correct it before dispatch, which I appreciated.</p><div class="rvw__reply"><div class="rvw__reply-head"><span><svg class="rvw__reply-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2 0 7l6 5V9c4 0 6 1 9 5-1-7-4-9-9-9V2Z"/></svg>Reply from Dalton &amp; Pierce</span><span>Sample date</span></div><p class="rvw__reply-text">Thank you, Alexander! We are glad our team could help correct the address before your order was sent.</p></div><button type="button" class="rvw__more" data-rvw-more aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sample-{{ section.id }}-15" data-more="{{ section.settings.more_label | escape }}" data-less="{{ section.settings.less_label | escape }}">{{ section.settings.more_label | escape }}</button></article>
<article class="rvw__card" id="sample-{{ section.id }}-16"><div class="rvw__meta"><span class="rvw__stars" data-rating="5" role="img" aria-label="Sample rating: 5 / 5"><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span></span></div><p class="rvw__sample-label">Sample review</p><p class="rvw__who"><strong>Chloe G.</strong>, Sample date</p><h3 class="rvw__title">Comfortable and easy to style</h3><p class="rvw__body">The dress works nicely with boots and a cardigan. I like that I can dress it up a little without feeling overdressed.</p><div class="rvw__reply"><div class="rvw__reply-head"><span><svg class="rvw__reply-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2 0 7l6 5V9c4 0 6 1 9 5-1-7-4-9-9-9V2Z"/></svg>Reply from Dalton &amp; Pierce</span><span>Sample date</span></div><p class="rvw__reply-text">Thank you, Chloe! We are pleased you are enjoying styling your dress for different occasions.</p></div><button type="button" class="rvw__more" data-rvw-more aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sample-{{ section.id }}-16" data-more="{{ section.settings.more_label | escape }}" data-less="{{ section.settings.less_label | escape }}">{{ section.settings.more_label | escape }}</button></article>
<article class="rvw__card" id="sample-{{ section.id }}-17"><div class="rvw__meta"><span class="rvw__stars" data-rating="5" role="img" aria-label="Sample rating: 5 / 5"><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span></span></div><p class="rvw__sample-label">Sample review</p><p class="rvw__who"><strong>Noah E.</strong>, Sample date</p><h3 class="rvw__title">Clear updates from the team</h3><p class="rvw__body">I had a question about my delivery and received a clear reply. It was helpful to know what to expect while waiting for the parcel.</p><div class="rvw__reply"><div class="rvw__reply-head"><span><svg class="rvw__reply-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2 0 7l6 5V9c4 0 6 1 9 5-1-7-4-9-9-9V2Z"/></svg>Reply from Dalton &amp; Pierce</span><span>Sample date</span></div><p class="rvw__reply-text">Thank you, Noah! We are happy our team could provide a helpful update about your delivery.</p></div><button type="button" class="rvw__more" data-rvw-more aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sample-{{ section.id }}-17" data-more="{{ section.settings.more_label | escape }}" data-less="{{ section.settings.less_label | escape }}">{{ section.settings.more_label | escape }}</button></article>
<article class="rvw__card" id="sample-{{ section.id }}-18"><div class="rvw__meta"><span class="rvw__stars" data-rating="5" role="img" aria-label="Sample rating: 5 / 5"><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span></span></div><p class="rvw__sample-label">Sample review</p><p class="rvw__who"><strong>Alice V.</strong>, Sample date</p><h3 class="rvw__title">A lovely matching outfit</h3><p class="rvw__body">The top and trousers look great together, but I’ve also been wearing them separately. It’s nice to have a few different ways to style them.</p><div class="rvw__reply"><div class="rvw__reply-head"><span><svg class="rvw__reply-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2 0 7l6 5V9c4 0 6 1 9 5-1-7-4-9-9-9V2Z"/></svg>Reply from Dalton &amp; Pierce</span><span>Sample date</span></div><p class="rvw__reply-text">Thank you, Alice! We are glad you are enjoying the pieces both together and separately.</p></div><button type="button" class="rvw__more" data-rvw-more aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sample-{{ section.id }}-18" data-more="{{ section.settings.more_label | escape }}" data-less="{{ section.settings.less_label | escape }}">{{ section.settings.more_label | escape }}</button></article>
<article class="rvw__card" id="sample-{{ section.id }}-19"><div class="rvw__meta"><span class="rvw__stars" data-rating="5" role="img" aria-label="Sample rating: 5 / 5"><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span><span>{{ star_full }}</span></span></div><p class="rvw__sample-label">Sample review</p><p class="rvw__who"><strong>Oliver Q.</strong>, Sample date</p><h3 class="rvw__title">Smart enough without the fuss</h3><p class="rvw__body">This knit is a good choice when I want something a little smarter than a sweatshirt. Comfortable, straightforward and easy to wear with jeans.</p><div class="rvw__reply"><div class="rvw__reply-head"><span><svg class="rvw__reply-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2 0 7l6 5V9c4 0 6 1 9 5-1-7-4-9-9-9V2Z"/></svg>Reply from Dalton &amp; Pierce</span><span>Sample date</span></div><p class="rvw__reply-text">Thank you, Oliver! We are pleased the knit gives you an easy option for a smarter everyday look.</p></div><button type="button" class="rvw__more" data-rvw-more aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sample-{{ section.id }}-19" data-more="{{ section.settings.more_label | escape }}" data-less="{{ section.settings.less_label | escape }}">{{ section.settings.more_label | escape }}</button></article>
{% else %}
{%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- assign full = block.settings.rating | plus: 0 -%}
        <article id="review-{{ section.id }}-{{ block.id }}" class="rvw__card" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <div class="rvw__meta">
            <span class="rvw__stars" data-rating="{{ full }}" role="img" aria-label="{{ full }} / 5">
              {%- for i in (1..5) -%}<span class="{% if i > full %}is-off{% endif %}">{{ star_full }}</span>{%- endfor -%}
            </span>
            {%- if block.settings.verified -%}
              <span class="rvw__ver"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" fill="#6b6f76"/><path d="m4.8 8.2 2.2 2.2 4.2-4.4" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>{{ section.settings.verified_label | escape }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
          {% if block.settings.is_sample %}<p class="rvw__sample-label">Sample review</p>{% endif %}<p class="rvw__who"><strong>{{ block.settings.name | escape }}</strong>{% if block.settings.date != blank %}, {{ block.settings.date | escape }}{% endif %}</p>
          {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}<h3 class="rvw__title">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</h3>{%- endif -%}
          <p class="rvw__body">{{ block.settings.body | escape }}</p>
          {%- if block.settings.reply != blank -%}
            <div class="rvw__reply">
              <div class="rvw__reply-head">
                <span><svg class="rvw__reply-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2 0 7l6 5V9c4 0 6 1 9 5-1-7-4-9-9-9V2Z"/></svg>{{ section.settings.reply_label | escape }} {{ section.settings.reply_name | escape }}</span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.reply_date | escape }}</span>
              </div>
              <p class="rvw__reply-text">{{ block.settings.reply | escape }}</p>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- assign body_len = block.settings.body | size -%}
          {%- if block.settings.body != blank or block.settings.reply != blank -%}
            <button type="button" class="rvw__more" data-rvw-more aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="review-{{ section.id }}-{{ block.id }}" data-more="{{ section.settings.more_label | escape }}" data-less="{{ section.settings.less_label | escape }}">{{ section.settings.more_label | escape }}</button>
          {%- endif -%}
        </article>
      {%- endfor -%}
{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</dp-reviews-wall>

<script>
if (!customElements.get('dp-reviews-wall')) customElements.define('dp-reviews-wall', class extends HTMLElement {
 connectedCallback() {
  if (this.controller) return;
  this.controller = new AbortController();
  const signal = this.controller.signal;
  this.addEventListener('click', event => {
   const button = event.target.closest('[data-rvw-more]'); if (!button) return;
   const open = button.closest('.rvw__card').classList.toggle('is-open');
   button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
   button.textContent = open ? button.dataset.less : button.dataset.more;
  }, {signal});
 }
 disconnectedCallback() { this.controller?.abort(); this.controller = null; this.observer?.disconnect(); }
});
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Reviews grid",
  "tag": "section",
  "max_blocks": 50,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "content_source",
      "label": "Review content",
      "default": "sample",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "sample",
          "label": "Sample reviews (demo)"
        },
        {
          "value": "custom",
          "label": "My customer review blocks"
        }
      ],
      "info": "The supplied examples are fictional and labelled as samples. Choose customer blocks for authentic reviews."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Header"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "verdict",
      "label": "Headline",
      "default": "Great"
